# Loop Run Log - ZCodeGraph

Append one entry per Daily Triage run. Keep this file local and prune entries
older than 30 days.

## Format

```json
{
  "run_id": "2026-07-06T09:00:00+08:00",
  "pattern": "daily-triage",
  "duration_s": 45,
  "items_found": 0,
  "actions_taken": 0,
  "escalations": 0,
  "tokens_estimate": 3000,
  "outcome": "no-op"
}
```

